+# Rollback contract tests. See docs/UPGRADE.md, section "Rollback contract".
+#
+# The constants below are golden values written by real releases:
+#
+# * PREVIOUS_RELEASE_MAIL_TOKEN, PREVIOUS_RELEASE_SESSION_COOKIE and
+#   PREVIOUS_RELEASE_CIPHER_TEXT were written by the release in production
